     0.05          0.000e+00                     no   n=  0   <- NO VALID INSTANTS, the zero is empty
     0.03          0.000e+00                     no   n=  0   <- NO VALID INSTANTS, the zero is empty

  The note's window is [0.24, 0.30]. Read off whether the error is
