==============================================================================
B. Injectivity of the real diagram, with no inversion formula
==============================================================================

  sigma = 0.24, 1000 instants, 499500 distinct pairs
    range of shape separations   3.132e-08 to 8.035e-01
    range of diagram separations 5.617e-12 to 2.387e-02
    lower Lipschitz ratio |dB|/|dS|: min 1.294e-04, median 3.528e-02
    among pairs with shape separation above 10 per cent of the
    maximum, the SMALLEST diagram separation is 3.220e-04
    -> no collision, injective on this sample

  sigma = 0.3, 1000 instants, 499500 distinct pairs
    range of shape separations   3.132e-08 to 8.035e-01
    range of diagram separations 2.403e-11 to 1.207e-01
    lower Lipschitz ratio |dB|/|dS|: min 5.515e-04, median 1.766e-01
    among pairs with shape separation above 10 per cent of the
    maximum, the SMALLEST diagram separation is 3.667e-03
    -> no collision, injective on this sample

==============================================================================
C. What survives exactly, regardless of the above
==============================================================================
  ORDER of the births equals ORDER of the opposite sides: 858 of 858
  This is the fact the braid rests on, and it is exact. The braid
  needs only the ordering, never the values, so it is untouched by
  whatever A and B say about recovering the actual side lengths.
